New mage skill: distill.

1) Distill destroys a piece of jewelry and draws what it carried into
   essence.
   - Jewelry only.  A shaman's bangle is how anything else becomes
     distillable.

2) Every stat on the piece deposits, not one chosen among them.
   - A ring of strength and dexterity yields both.
   - How much depends on the size of the stat and on how well you know the
     work, and it is never nothing.

3) What you deposit goes into an essence of that stat you already carry.
   - Only when you have none does it make a new one.
   - This is what lets essence grow at all: charges scattered across
     duplicates never reach anything.

4) Armor is not among the stats an essence can hold.

See HELP DISTILL and HELP ESSENCE.
